# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Static pages are served from flat files, so no redirect rules are needed here.
# Cloudflare Pages automatically 308-redirects /page.html to /page, which is why
# every internal link, canonical URL and sitemap entry must use clean URLs.
#
# Add explicit 301s here only when a page is renamed or removed, e.g.:
# /old-slug  /new-slug  301
